em: My shadow reached the station before I did. What implied meaning is best supported?&lt;/p&gt;</text></questiontext><generalfeedback format="html"><text /></generalfeedback><defaultgrade>1.0000000</defaultgrade><penalty>0.3333333</penalty><single>true</single><shuffleanswers>true</shuffleanswers><answernumbering>none</answernumbering><showstandardinstruction>1</showstandardinstruction><correctfeedback format="html"><text /></correctfeedback><partiallycorrectfeedback format="html"><text /></partiallycorrectfeedback><incorrectfeedback format="html"><text /></incorrectfeedback><answer fraction="0.0" format="html"><text>&lt;p&gt;The station is definitely closed.&lt;/p&gt;</text><feedback format="html"><text /></feedback></answer><answer fraction="0.0" format="html"><text>&lt;p&gt;The shadow bought a ticket.&lt;/p&gt;</text><feedback format="html"><text /></feedback></answer><answer fraction="0.0" format="html"><text>&lt;p&gt;The poem is about noon only.&lt;/p&gt;</text><feedback format="html"><text /></feedback></answer><answer fraction="100.0" format="html"><text>&lt;p&gt;The shadow reaching the station first suggests anticipation or anxiety about departure.&lt;/p&gt;</text><feedback format="html"><text /></feedback></answer></question><question type="multichoice"><name><text>CW_U04_L03_R_Q09</text></name><questiontext format="html"><text>&lt;p&gt;Poem: The photograph curled at the edges, smiling anyway. Which interpretation is strongest?&lt;/p&gt;</text></questiontext><generalfeedback format="html"><text /></generalfeedback><defaultgrade>1.0000000</defaultgrade><penalty>0.3333333</penalty><single>true</single><shuffleanswers>true</shuffleanswers><answernumbering>none</answernumbering><showstandardinstruction>1</showstandardinstruction><correctfeedback format="html"><text /></correctfeedback><partiallycorrectfeedback format="html"><text /></partiallycorrectfeedback><incorrectfeedback format="html"><text /></incorrectfeedback><answer fraction="100.0" format="html"><t